article><article class="update-card"><span class="eyebrow">15 October 2026 UTC · source intake v0.1</span><h2>Additional-workstream narrative manuscript captured</h2><p>Review candidate 0.15 is preserved as a separate synthesis with its original PDF hash, complete text extract and page index. Intake preserves source status and leaves scientific replay, independent review and physical correspondence gates unchanged.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/papers/#narrative-v015">Read the manuscript →</a> · <a class="text-link" href="/sources/narrative-v0.15/INGEST_RECEIPT_v0.1.json">Intake record ↓</a></p></article><section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">01</div><div><h2>Milestones and exit gates.</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Exit criterion</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 · Source intake</td><td>Versions, hashes, coverage and missing inputs recorded</td><td>Complete for accessible sources</td></tr><tr><td>2 · Public foundation</td><td>Primer, results, dynamics, bridge limits and primary papers linked</td><td>Implemented in this edition</td></tr><tr><td>3 · Claim reconciliation</td><td>Every consequential historical assertion mapped to a current disposition and dependencies</td><td>448-row source/status overlay complete; proof DAG remains open</td></tr><tr><td>4 · Independent review</td><td>Non-constructor review of one bounded result recorded</td><td>Pending</td></tr><tr><td>5 · Physical evaluation</td><td>Eligible measurement passes its frozen independent bridge test</td><td>Pending</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">02</div><div><h2>Current development frontiers.</h2><div class="news-list"><article><time>13 October 2026</time><h3>Receipt gap and common deadline</h3><p>34 write slots; 44 versus 66 total-slot comparisons. Dimensionless probability does not select physical energy or area.</p><a class="citation" href="/sources/?id=R40">R40 ↗</a></ar